what is traversal?
it checks or read the elements one by one.
                                    BASIC PROGRAM
public class Main{
  public static void main(String[] args){
      int[] n={1,2,3,4,5,6};
      for(int i=0;i<=n.length();i++){
  System.out.println(n[i]);
    }
  }
}
OUTPUT:
1
2
3
4
5

                                       
